Subject: [PATCH] fix(pdf): robust LLM JSON parsing for planning extraction
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Claude Vision often returned truncated/malformed JSON (max_tokens=4000),
causing "Réponse d'extraction invalide (JSON malformé)". Raise the token
budget, repair common JSON issues, close truncated objects, and retry /
ask Claude to fix when needed. Also accept PDF uploads with loose MIME.
